<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>纽约时报 实时热点</title><link>https://rss.nytimes.com/services/xml/rss/nyt/HomePage.xml</link><description>纽约时报 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 02:57:50 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>沙利文承认阿拉斯加州参议员竞选佩尔托拉</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/us/politics/dan-sullivan-concedes-alaska-senate-race-mary-peltola.html</link><description>在特朗普政府放弃一项旨在阻止比赛认证的诉讼的可能性不大的五天后，这位共和党人做出了让步。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [纽约时报] &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/us/politics/dan-sullivan-concedes-alaska-senate-race-mary-peltola.html'&gt;沙利文承认阿拉斯加州参议员竞选佩尔托拉&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Sullivan Concedes Alaska Senate Race to Peltola&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/us/politics/dan-sullivan-concedes-alaska-senate-race-mary-peltola.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 23:58:18 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>密西西比州参议院竞选甚至不是今年最大的冷门</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/upshot/midterm-elections-upsets-predictions.html</link><description>我们找到了 2026 年中期选举中最不可能的获胜者。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [纽约时报] &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/upshot/midterm-elections-upsets-predictions.html'&gt;密西西比州参议院竞选甚至不是今年最大的冷门&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：The Mississippi Senate Race Wasn’t Even This Year’s Biggest Upset&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/upshot/midterm-elections-upsets-predictions.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 20:19:49 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>布罗德里克赢得田纳西州众议院竞选，民主党获得 30 年来最大多数席位</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/us/politics/tennessee-house-election-results-broderick-wins.html</link><description>在一名技术支持人员在没有播放任何电视广告的情况下罢免了八届任期的共和党人后，民主党在众议院的中期溃败继续扩大。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [纽约时报] &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/us/politics/tennessee-house-election-results-broderick-wins.html'&gt;布罗德里克赢得田纳西州众议院竞选，民主党获得 30 年来最大多数席位&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Broderick Wins Tennessee House Race, Giving Democrats Largest Majority in 30 Years&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/us/politics/tennessee-house-election-results-broderick-wins.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 19:26:32 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Nvidia 和 A.I. 股市下跌股市抹去了周一的部分涨势</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/business/stocks-sp500-huang-nvidia.html</link><description>受英伟达事件以及 Anthropic 公开发行后股价涨跌影响，股价连续几天大幅波动。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [纽约时报] &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/business/stocks-sp500-huang-nvidia.html'&gt;Nvidia 和 A.I. 股市下跌股市抹去了周一的部分涨势&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Stock Markets Slip as Nvidia and A.I. Stocks Erase Some of Monday’s Rally&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/business/stocks-sp500-huang-nvidia.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 21:12:53 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>当调查人员检查公司客户时，布兰奇淡化了对英伟达的质疑</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/us/politics/nvidia-justice-department-todd-blanche.html</link><description>据知情人士透露，司法部调查人员已收集证据，证明英伟达的高性能计算机芯片被其他公司非法转移到中国。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [纽约时报] &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/us/politics/nvidia-justice-department-todd-blanche.html'&gt;当调查人员检查公司客户时，布兰奇淡化了对英伟达的质疑&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Blanche Downplays Questions Over Nvidia as Investigators Examine Company’s Customers&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/us/politics/nvidia-justice-department-todd-blanche.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 23:27:37 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>黄仁勋向 Nvidia 员工道歉并表示正在接受治疗</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/technology/jensen-huang-apology-nvidia-ceo.html</link><description>回到公司一天后，黄先生承认自己违反了英伟达的行为准则，并“犯了一些可怕的错误”。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [纽约时报] &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/technology/jensen-huang-apology-nvidia-ceo.html'&gt;黄仁勋向 Nvidia 员工道歉并表示正在接受治疗&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Jensen Huang Apologizes to Nvidia Employees, Says He Is in Therapy&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/technology/jensen-huang-apology-nvidia-ceo.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 21:46:11 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>爱荷华州即将发生爆炸。居民对此无能为力。</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/us/iowa-ammunition-plant-lead-explosion-middletown.html</link><description>米德尔敦毗邻一处陆军设施，周三将在那里引爆危险化学品，居民们正在用胶带封住门，准备逃离。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [纽约时报] &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/us/iowa-ammunition-plant-lead-explosion-middletown.html'&gt;爱荷华州即将发生爆炸。居民对此无能为力。&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：An Explosion Is Coming to Iowa. And Residents Can’t Do a Thing About It.&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/us/iowa-ammunition-plant-lead-explosion-middletown.html</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 02:06:53 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>爱荷华州陆军弹药厂爆炸事件按计划于周三上午发生</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/climate/iowa-army-ammunition-plant-explostion.html</link><description>冰冻温度可能会使这些化学物质变得更加不稳定，而风可能会将有毒的铅羽带到 100 英里之外。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [纽约时报] &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/climate/iowa-army-ammunition-plant-explostion.html'&gt;爱荷华州陆军弹药厂爆炸事件按计划于周三上午发生&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Army’s Iowa Ammunition Plant Explosion on Schedule for Wednesday Morning&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/climate/iowa-army-ammunition-plant-explostion.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 21:13:20 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>